title the language learns and -- the composed condition lands whole, and the face's uncertainty law speaks in Glow on metal
prompt kg, be creative, Lindy-first crux-first. The crux in language custody: the face's deepest law -- an unknown that carries an answer refuses -- was unsayable in Glow, whose conditional spoke one comparison at a time.
think The rune ruling, made under the seat's language custody with Keaton's overrule standing: the shop takes the word spelling `and` beside gth, eq, and mul (the shop speaks words), and the ancestor's ?& rune -- which Rishi in this very tree already speaks -- stays an alias-sameness door for full Glow later. The mechanism, by the mul precedent proven twice: rune_shop_gate.rye gains BodyKind cond_and_pair, four GateSpec fields (and_op1, and_rhs1, and_op2, and_rhs2), a parse branch grafted before the gth/eq wall reading `?: (and (gth|eq face dec) (gth|eq face2 dec)) dec dec` over exactly the pair header with faces in header order, and a tail-validation arm refusing a dangling third face. lower_shop_gate.rye gains the expect_for arm evaluating both inner conds over the demo pair, welcome and argv emit arms lowering both comparisons as one Rye boolean through fn bartis_and, a new emit_argv2_and_speaking_main function, and the composed kind answering PairNotYetLowered at the eight shape-sample seams. Parse and emit landed in ONE movement -- the -a/-b split existed because the precedent was being cut; with it proven twice the whole rune lands in one lap.
think Proven: six new witness legs GREEN beside all 126 elder greens on the FIRST build -- parse to cond_and_pair with all four fields read back, the welcome emit containing (kind == 2) and (len > 0), the argv emit speaking two samples, and three refusals by name (no pair header, faces out of order, mul as an inner op). Then the payoff desk src/gate/gate-lantern-unknown-law-u32.glow speaks the face's own law as the language's first composed condition -- ?: (and (eq kind 2) (gth answer_len 0)) 0 1 -- and answers on metal: (2,5) is 0, an unknown carrying an answer refuses; (2,0) is 1, the honest unknown is lawful; (0,5) is 1, a settled answer is lawful. The worker gains the stem in both its allowlist and its two-argument lane; the lantern witness gains the three metal legs and two new parity anchors (the FaceKind enum order that seats unknown at ordinal 2, and the AnswerWithUnknown name) so the two spellings of one law can never drift alone. TAME clean; zero new shop width hits.
obs The creative arc closes on itself: the face seated a law in Rye at 233639, and forty minutes later the language grew the exact composition needed to say that law in Glow -- the interface half pulling the language forward, which is what one seat holding both custody and the lane is FOR. The and admits gth and eq inner conds alone in v1; or-composition, nested composition, and the ?& rune spelling are named doors behind their own laps.
